### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:3003/clientes

### Buscar cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:3003/clientes/1

### Buscar cliente inexistente (404)
GET http://localhost:3003/clientes/999

### Cadastrar cliente
POST http://localhost:3003/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Joao",
  "sobrenome": "Silva",
  "telefone": "46999999999",
  "email": "joao@email.com"
}

### Cadastrar sem campos obrigatórios (400)
POST http://localhost:3003/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Joao"
}

### Cadastrar e-mail duplicado (409)
POST http://localhost:3003/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Outro",
  "sobrenome": "Cliente",
  "telefone": "46900000000",
  "email": "joao@email.com"
}